From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn <tyn@localhost>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:58:33 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: add the MO6TWPC save system and save menu

TYN-only (new files, new SaveDataType/SaveMenuType values; other games are
untouched). Shared files touched, all gated on InstructionSet::MO6TWPC:
src/data/savesystem.cpp (the loaders report the real error code to
SW_SAVEERRORCODE, as they already do for CC/CHLCC) and src/vm/inst_system.cpp
(AutoSave(3) persists the quick save, the PC scripts never write it).

